<Grid
  xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
<Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
    </Grid.RowDefinitions>
    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="10"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
	<!--TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Text="1985-8-18" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}"/-->
	<TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}">
		IMMEDIATE
		<LineBreak/>
		O 04 2200Z MAR 88
	</TextBlock>
    <!--TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Text="05:00Z (06:00L)" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}"/-->

    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="FM"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="RED BANNER PACIFIC FLEET"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="TO"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="CO {TaskForceName}"/>
	<TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="INFO"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}">
		10th OPERATIONAL SQN
		<LineBreak/>
		10th SUBMARINE DIV
	</TextBlock>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="7" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="SUBJ"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="7" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="OPERATION ORDER"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="9" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" TextWrapping="Wrap">
		SECRET
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		1. (S) {TaskForceName} is to destroy Japanese withdrawal convoy in Tokyo Bay.
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		2. (S) Limited submarine threat in the area. Destruction of submarine wolfpack on 26 FEB 88 has significantly reduced enemy submarine activity. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		3. (S) Enemy air threat medium, expect airstrikes by long range US aircraft from Guam. Japanese Atsugi Air Base still functional, some F-1 and F-4 fighter bombers on hand. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		4. (S) Enemy surface threat high. National technical means indicate large USN surface force centered on NEW JERSEY BB-62 and LONG BEACH CGN-9 sortied from Guam 48 hours ago, course North West. Remaining Japanese warships also in Tokyo Bay, likely acting as convoy escort. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		5. (S) Former Japanese airfield in Hamamatsu available for friendly aircraft. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		6. (S) {TaskForceName} is to transit South to OPBOX Borodino once mission is complete. Good Luck, Comrade.
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		SIGNED: Khvatov
		<LineBreak/>
		KTOF
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		SECRET
		<LineBreak/>
		DECL OADR BT
	  </TextBlock>
</Grid>